        <h3>Largest absolute month-over-month shocks</h3>
        <table><thead><tr><th>Month</th><th>Price</th><th>MoM USD</th><th>MoM %</th><th>YoY USD</th><th>YoY %</th></tr></thead><tbody>{shock_table}</tbody></table>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Largest absolute year-over-year shocks</h3>
        <table><thead><tr><th>Month</th><th>Price</th><th>YoY USD</th><th>YoY %</th></tr></thead><tbody>{yoy_table}</tbody></table>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>1974 oil shock in the data:</strong> Jan 1974 records {fmt_price(point(date(1974,1,1))['price'])}, up {point(date(1974,1,1))['mom_abs']:+.2f} USD/bbl month over month and {point(date(1974,1,1))['yoy_pct']:+.1f}% year over year.</li>
      <li><strong>2008 crisis cycle:</strong> Jul 2008 is the dataset maximum at {fmt_price(max_row['price'])}; Oct 2008 has the largest absolute MoM drop ({max_abs_mom['mom_abs']:+.2f} USD/bbl), and Jul 2009 has the largest absolute YoY drop ({max_abs_yoy['yoy_abs']:+.2f} USD/bbl).</li>
      <li><strong>COVID-period shock:</strong> Mar 2020 falls to {fmt_price(point(date(2020,3,1))['price'])}, a {point(date(2020,3,1))['mom_pct']:+.1f}% MoM change, the largest negative monthly percentage change in the dataset.</li>
      <li><strong>2022 repricing:</strong> Mar 2022 reaches {fmt_price(point(date(2022,3,1))['price'])}, up {point(date(2022,3,1))['mom_abs']:+.2f} USD/bbl and {point(date(2022,3,1))['mom_pct']:+.1f}% versus Feb 2022.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="statistical-summary">
    <h2>Statistical Summary &amp; Distribution</h2>
    <p>The distribution is wide and right-skewed. The all-sample range is {fmt_price(max(prices)-min(prices))}; the interquartile band runs from {fmt_price(quantile(prices,.25))} to {fmt_price(quantile(prices,.75))}; and the 95th percentile is {fmt_price(quantile(prices,.95))}, reflecting the concentration of extreme high-price observations in the post-2000 period.</p>
    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="chart-wrap">{histogram(prices)}</div>
      <div>
        <table><thead><tr><th>Statistic</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody>{desc_table}</tbody></table>
