      <li><strong>Volatility baseline:</strong> analysts should benchmark short-term moves against the full-sample monthly standard deviation of {fmt_price(statistics.stdev(prices))} and the historical single-month extremes of {max_abs_mom['mom_abs']:+.2f} USD/bbl and {max_neg_mom_pct['mom_pct']:+.1f}%.</li>
