      <li><strong>Data limitation:</strong> the source documentation notes that late-period observations approaching 2026 may be forecasts or estimates. This report does not fabricate or supplement values; all statistics are computed directly from the supplied CSV.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <div class="footer">Generated from /app/benchmark/data.csv. Calculations use nominal monthly prices; no inflation adjustment is applied.</div>
</main>
